docs\api_reference.md:388:| `RichTextJsonCodec({migrations})` | Encode/decode the canonical versioned rich JSON. Optional `DocumentMigrationRegistry` lifts older versions. |
docs\api_reference.md:389:| `LegacyWenJsonCodec()` | Decode the old `wenz_editor` block-list format. |
docs\api_reference.md:390:| `PlainTextCodec({omitEmptyBlocks})` | Export to plain text (paragraphs blank-line separated, media sentinels; image sentinel prefers caption, then alt text). |
docs\api_reference.md:391:| `MarkdownCodec()` | GFM Markdown import/export. `encode` → Markdown; `decode` → document (line-oriented state machine; unrecognised lines fall back to paragraphs). Image caption uses Markdown image title: `![alt](src "caption")`; video blocks export/import through the Wenz `![video](src)` placeholder; file and block embed content degrade to readable text/links on import. |
docs\api_reference.md:392:| `HtmlCodec()` | HTML fragment import/export via `package:html`. `encode` → HTML; `decode` → document (DOM walk; malformed HTML falls back to paragraphs). Image block captions use `<figure><img ...><figcaption>...`; inline image embeds preserve `altText`/`caption`/`width`/`height` through `<img>` attributes; Wenz file links, video tags, and `BlockEmbedNode` preserve metadata through `data-*` attributes; table `rowspan`/`colspan` maps to `TableCellNode` spans. |
docs\api_reference.md:393:| `DocumentVersionSnapshotJsonCodec()` | Encode/decode one `DocumentVersionSnapshot` or a snapshot list for app-owned version history persistence. |
docs\api_reference.md:395:| `decodeWithMigrations(source, registry)` | Helper: JSON decode + migrate in one step. |
docs\api_reference.md:396:| `DocumentDecodeException` | Structured codec error (`reason`, `jsonPath?`, `raw?`). |
docs\api_reference.md:407:| `WenzDocumentExporter<TOutput>` | App-owned export adapter contract. Implementations receive a `RichTextDocument` and return bytes, files, URLs, or another app-defined output type. |
